sequenceDiagram
    actor Sender
    participant App as Packaroo app
    participant Store as StoreKit
    participant Worker as Postcard Worker
    participant Analytics as Aggregate analytics
    participant Share as System share sheet
    Sender->>App: Tap paper plane
    alt Existing unexpired receipt
        App->>Share: Share saved link
        Note over App,Share: No upload, allowance charge, or creation event
    else New or edited postcard
        App->>App: Check subscription, free original, or correction
        alt No creation entitlement
            App-->>Sender: Present postcard paywall
            App-->>Analytics: postcard_paywall_shown via Worker
            opt Successful production purchase in this sheet
                Sender->>Store: Purchase subscription
                Store-->>App: Verified active entitlement
                App-->>Analytics: postcard_subscription_purchased via Worker
            end
            Note over Sender,App: Return to the composer and tap to share again
        else Creation allowed
            opt Uses free original or free correction
                App-->>Sender: Explain allowance and ask for confirmation
                Sender->>App: Confirm Create Link
            end
            App->>Worker: Upload postcard and creation category
            alt Hosting succeeds
                Worker->>Worker: Save card with one-year expiry
                Worker-->>Analytics: postcard_created, category
                Worker-->>App: Link and expiration receipt
                App->>App: Validate and cache receipt; consume free allowance if applicable
                App->>App: Save hosted version in local library
                App->>Share: Open share sheet with link
                Note over Sender,Share: Cancel does not restore allowance; link can be reshared
            else Hosting or receipt validation fails
                App-->>Sender: Show error; keep draft and allowance
                Note over App,Worker: If hosting succeeded but receipt was lost, server creation still counts
            end
        end
    end
    Note over App,Analytics: Best-effort analytics never gates sharing; debug app reporting is suppressed
